sequenceDiagram
    title CI run
    actor D as Developer
    participant G as GitHub
    participant R as CI runner
    D->>G: git push
    G->>R: Trigger workflow
    R->>R: Install and build
    break tests fail
        R-->>G: Status: failed
        G-->>D: Email
    end
    R-->>G: Status: passed
    Note over R: Runs on ubuntu-latest
